  "_about": [
    "Guardrail hook payload matrix. One entry = one PreToolUse payload fed to one hook; the test asserts the exit code.",
    "Fields: name, hook (destructive|secret|boundary), expect (\"block\" -> exit 2, \"allow\" -> exit 0, or {win32, default}),",
    "tool_name + tool_input (payload body) or raw (verbatim stdin), agent_type (payload field Claude Code sets inside a subagent),",
    "env (extra environment; \"\" unsets), cwd (payload.cwd, default {{root}}), deferred (reason this case is skipped until a later phase), source.",
    "Placeholders {{root}}, {{root-upper}} and {{home}} are replaced at run time. Remove a case's `deferred` when the hook is expected to satisfy it."
